{"id":"vod_md_64758","vodId":"64758","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"野原广志 午餐流派","name_cn":"野原广志 午餐流派","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20251004-1/8f4a63725c248a491f5add0feb8c545c.jpg"},"summary":"原作漫画作者是塚原洋一，作品讲述了在《蜡笔小新》系列中未曾展现的、作为上班族为家庭工作的广志在有限的零花钱和时间中，对午餐的极致追求。广志不仅以美食评论的方式品尝美味，还包含了各种料理的冷知识和制作方法，以及上班族特有的“请后辈吃饭的烦恼”、“业务间隙的快餐”、“对上司的抱怨”等职场人士的共鸣点，因此得到了20至30岁男女的广泛共鸣。此外，该衍生作还融入了《蜡笔小新》特有的幽默，以及广志在品尝“热辣”、“辛辣”、“甜美”等不同料理时展现的各种“颜艺”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-19 23:41:02","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251004/bVkXg9k4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251010/2TFEaFh0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251017/W6wEuQlO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251025/W996P8gG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251031/t7ibRb8j/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251107/05Tc8GQv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251114/kmlEhYBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251121/a7wWVcnV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251128/Yt5kaFQs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251205/uvyWnufD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251213/mvcJmj72/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20251219/V1tMIAyd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:18.513Z"}